ofissionais tecnicamente excelentes acabam trabalhando sempre no limite.<\/p>\n<p>Foi observando esses padr\u00f5es, ano ap\u00f3s ano, que passei a usar Excel, Python e automa\u00e7\u00f5es pra resolver<b> problemas reais de opera\u00e7\u00e3o<\/b> \u2014 reduzindo tarefas repetitivas, eliminando retrabalho e dando mais previsibilidade ao dia a dia do escrit\u00f3rio.<\/p>\n<p>O <b>RADAR<\/b> nasceu dessa mesma l\u00f3gica, aplicada a um problema espec\u00edfico: parar de perguntar &#8220;como t\u00e1 aquele projeto?&#8221; e deixar a pr\u00f3pria planilha avisar sozinha.<\/p>\n<\/span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44fa00d9 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"44fa00d9\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-2faecf48 elementor-widget__width-inherit elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"2faecf48\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>Se voc\u00ea chegou at\u00e9 aqui, <\/b><span style=\"color: #f6c35a;\"><b><span style=\"color: #f6c35a;\">seja<\/span> sincero\u2026<\/b><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5343cd9c elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5343cd9c\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><b>At\u00e9 quando voc\u00ea vai continuar cobrando prazo na m\u00e3o?<\/b><\/p><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\ud83d\udeab \u00a0 \ud83d\udcb8 \u00a0 \ud83d\udc4e\ud83c\udffb<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6878a38a elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"6878a38a\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>A planilha manual n\u00e3o vai se atualizar sozinha.<\/p><p>O WhatsApp de cobran\u00e7a n\u00e3o vai parar de ser necess\u00e1rio.<\/p><p><span style=\"color: #f6c35a;\"><b>A \u00fanica coisa que muda isso \u00e9 automatizar a parte chata \u2014 e \u00e9 exatamente isso que o RADAR faz.<\/b><\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1da3f8e6 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1da3f8e6\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-21488491 elementor-view-stacked elementor-shape-circle elementor-widget elementor-widget-icon\" data-id=\"21488491\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"icon.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-icon\">\n\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-fas-arrow-down\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M413.1 222.5l22.2 22.2c9.4 9.4 9.4 24.6 0 33.9L241 473c-9.4 9.4-24.6 9.4-33.9 0L12.7 278.6c-9.4-9.4-9.4-24.6 0-33.9l22.2-22.2c9.5-9.5 25-9.3 34.3.4L184 343.4V56c0-13.3 10.7-24 24-24h32c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24v287.4l114.8-120.5c9.3-9.8 24.8-10 34.3-.4z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1a4dc8e7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"1a4dc8e7\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot